  values (v_part_1, 'Article (a / an / the) ও Preposition (in / on / at)', 'lesson-09', 'Lesson 9 from English Foundation.', '{"type":"doc","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"ছোট শব্দ — কিন্তু সবচেয়ে বেশি ভুল এখানেই"}]},{"type":"callout","attrs":{"variant":"note"},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"🎯 এই Lesson শেষে তুমি যা পারবে"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"১. a / an / the কোথায় বসবে আর কোথায় বসবে না — নিশ্চিতভাবে বুঝবে।"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"২. সময়ের সাথে in / on / at-এর সঠিক ব্যবহার শিখবে (at 5 pm, on Friday, in July)।"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"৩. স্থানের সাথে in / on / at-এর সঠিক ব্যবহার শিখবে।"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"৪. আরও ১৪টি দরকারি preposition উচ্চারণসহ শিখবে।"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"৫. বাংলাদেশি শিক্ষার্থীদের ৮টি চিরায়ত preposition-ভুল এড়াতে পারবে।"}]}]},{"type":"callout","attrs":{"variant":"note"},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"🔄 শুরুর আগে — Lesson 8 ঝালাই করো"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"১. He ____ speak English. (can/cans)"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"২. ভুল ঠিক করো: I can to swim."}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"৩. \"তোমার আসার দরকার নেই\" — ইংরেজি করো।"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"৪. could-এ কোন অক্ষর চুপ? উত্তর:"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"1. can"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"2. I can swim."}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"3. You don''t have to come."}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"4. \"l\""}]}]},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":2},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"অংশ ১ — a / an (অনির্দিষ্ট Article)"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"যেকোনো একটা — 